//===== rAthena Script =======================================
//= Episode 17.1 - Illusion Enchants
//===== Description: =========================================
//= [Walkthrough Conversion]
//= Illusion related merchants and enchanters
//===== Changelog: ===========================================
//= 1.0 Initial release [crazyarashi]
//= 1.1 Optimizations and cleanup [Everade]
